<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Repco stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Repco stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timber and gaming concern Repco Holdings Bhd stock was suspended on Thursday afternoon at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of the firm last traded down 50 cents to 79.50 ringgit prior to the suspension.  </p>
<p>An official at the company said the suspension was pending an announcement, but did not disclose the nature of the news.</p>
<p>She said an announcement should be made within 10 market days.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
